<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Patch>
	<!-- Overrides for 1.6\Defs\Things_ItemDefs\Items_BodyParts.xml -->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs</xpath>
		<value>
			<ThingDef ParentName="BodyPartProstheticBase">
				<defName>RK_FakeEar</defName>
				<label>fake ear</label>
				<description>천으로 만들어진 가짜 귀입니다. 랫킨의 큰 귀는 단순히 소리를 듣는것 뿐만 아닌 하나의 상징이자 랫킨 사회에서의 큰 의미를 갖습니다.</description>
				<techLevel>Medieval</techLevel>
				<graphicData>
					<texPath>Things/Item/BodyPart/Mods/RK_FakeEar</texPath>
					<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
					<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
					<color>(1,1,1)</color>
				</graphicData>
				<recipeMaker>
					<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
						<li>RK_ElectricTailoringBench</li>
						<li>RK_HandTailoringBench</li>
					</recipeUsers>
					<researchPrerequisite>Prosthesis_making_B1</researchPrerequisite>
				</recipeMaker>
				<costList>
					<Cloth>30</Cloth>
				</costList>
				<statBases>
					<WorkToMake>3000</WorkToMake>
					<Mass>0.5</Mass>
				</statBases>
				<techHediffsTags>
					<li>Simple</li>
				</techHediffsTags>
			</ThingDef>
		</value>
	</Operation>
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs</xpath>
		<value>
			<ThingDef ParentName="BodyPartProstheticBase">
				<defName>RK_FakeTail</defName>
				<label>fake tail</label>
				<description>천을 꼬아서 만든 밧줄 꼬리입니다. 랫킨의 꼬리는 균형을 담당하고 있습니다. 아무래도 움직이지 않아 균형을 잡기 힘들지만 없는것보단 좋아보입니다.</description>
				<techLevel>Medieval</techLevel>
				<graphicData>
					<texPath>Things/Item/BodyPart/Mods/RK_FakeTail</texPath>
					<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
					<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
					<color>(1,1,1)</color>
				</graphicData>
				<recipeMaker>
					<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
						<li>RK_ElectricTailoringBench</li>
						<li>RK_HandTailoringBench</li>
					</recipeUsers>
				</recipeMaker>
				<costList>
					<Cloth>40</Cloth>
				</costList>
				<statBases>
					<WorkToMake>3000</WorkToMake>
					<Mass>0.5</Mass>
				</statBases>
				<techHediffsTags>
					<li>Simple</li>
				</techHediffsTags>
			</ThingDef>
		</value>
	</Operation>
	<Operation Class="SK.PatchOperationReplaceExtended">
		<xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="RK_Thing_BionicTail"]</xpath>
		<value>
			<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
			<recipeMaker>
				<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
					<li>RK_ElectricTailoringBench</li>
				</recipeUsers>
				<researchPrerequisite>FlakArmor</researchPrerequisite>
			</recipeMaker>
			<costList>
				<Steel>15</Steel>
				<SteelBar>10</SteelBar>
				<ElectronicComponents>7</ElectronicComponents>
				<ComponentSpacer>4</ComponentSpacer>
			</costList>
			<graphicData>
				<texPath>Things/Item/BodyPart/Mods/RK_Thing_BionicTail</texPath>
				<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
				<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
				<color>(1,1,1)</color>
			</graphicData>
			<statBases>
				<WorkToMake>26000</WorkToMake>
				<Mass>5</Mass>
			</statBases>
			<techHediffsTags>
				<li>Advanced</li>
			</techHediffsTags>
		</value>
	</Operation>
</Patch>
